<title>GERMANY: UPS names new Europe president.</title>
<headline>UPS names new Europe president.</headline>
<dateline>FRANKFURT 1997-06-02</dateline>
<text>
<p>United Parcel Service of America said it has appointed Randy Pulito as new UPS Europe president.</p>
<p>Pulito, previously vice-president Europe operations, replaces Ed Reitman who will manage a new technology project at UPS head office in Atlanta.</p>
<p>The new Europe president is responsible for all operations in Europe and business development in eastern Europe, the Middle East and Africa.</p>
